    "body": "Switching to bits.Sub (which is intrinsified unlike bits.Sub32) improved the output a lot.\n\nHowever, I still see a IMUL3Q after [CL 715044](https://go.dev/cl/715044) with the multiplication. (Code at [https://go.dev/cl/717121/1](https://go.dev/cl/717121/1).)\n\n```\ncrypto/internal/fips140/mldsa.fieldSub STEXTFIPS nosplit size=30 args=0x8 locals=0x0 funcid=0x0 align=0x0\n\t0x0000 00000 (crypto/internal/fips140/mldsa/field.go:79)\tTEXT\tcrypto/internal/fips140/mldsa.fieldSub(SB), NOSPLIT|NOFRAME|ABIInternal, $0-8\n\t0x0000 00000 (crypto/internal/fips140/mldsa/field.go:79)\tFUNCDATA\t$0, gclocals\u00b7g5+hNtRBP6YXNjfog7aZjQ==(SB)\n\t0x0000 00000 (crypto/internal/fips140/mldsa/field.go:79)\tFUNCDATA\t$1, gclocals\u00b7g5+hNtRBP6YXNjfog7aZjQ==(SB)\n\t0x0000 00000 (crypto/internal/fips140/mldsa/field.go:79)\tFUNCDATA\t$5, crypto/internal/fips140/mldsa.fieldSub.arginfo1(SB)\n\t0x0000 00000 (crypto/internal/fips140/mldsa/field.go:79)\tFUNCDATA\t$6, crypto/internal/fips140/mldsa.fieldSub.argliveinfo(SB)\n\t0x0000 00000 (crypto/internal/fips140/mldsa/field.go:79)\tPCDATA\t$3, $1\n\t0x0000 00000 (crypto/internal/fips140/mldsa/field.go:80)\tSUBL\tBX, AX\n\t0x0002 00002 (crypto/internal/fips140/mldsa/field.go:80)\tLEAL\t8380417(AX), CX\n\t0x0008 00008 (<unknown line number>)\tNOP\n\t0x0008 00008 (crypto/internal/fips140/mldsa/field.go:70)\tSUBQ\t$8380417, CX\n\t0x000f 00015 (crypto/internal/fips140/mldsa/field.go:70)\tSBBQ\tDX, DX\n\t0x0012 00018 (crypto/internal/fips140/mldsa/field.go:71)\tIMUL3Q\t$-8380417, DX, DX\n\t0x0019 00025 (crypto/internal/fips140/mldsa/field.go:71)\tLEAQ\t(CX)(DX*1), AX\n\t0x001d 00029 (crypto/internal/fips140/mldsa/field.go:81)\tRET\n\t0x0000 29 d8 8d 88 01 e0 7f 00 48 81 e9 01 e0 7f 00 48  ).......H......H\n\t0x0010 19 d2 48 69 d2 ff 1f 80 ff 48 8d 04 11 c3        ..Hi.....H....\n```\n\nAnd I don't see a CMOV with subtle.ConstantTimeSelect. (Code at [https://go.dev/cl/717121/2](https://go.dev/cl/717121/2).)\n\n```\ncrypto/internal/fips140/mldsa.fieldSub STEXTFIPS nosplit size=39 args=0x8 locals=0x0 funcid=0x0 align=0x0\n\t0x0000 00000 (crypto/internal/fips140/mldsa/field.go:79)\tTEXT\tcrypto/internal/fips140/mldsa.fieldSub(SB), NOSPLIT|NOFRAME|ABIInternal, $0-8\n\t0x0000 00000 (crypto/internal/fips140/mldsa/field.go:79)\tFUNCDATA\t$0, gclocals\u00b7g5+hNtRBP6YXNjfog7aZjQ==(SB)\n\t0x0000 00000 (crypto/internal/fips140/mldsa/field.go:79)\tFUNCDATA\t$1, gclocals\u00b7g5+hNtRBP6YXNjfog7aZjQ==(SB)\n\t0x0000 00000 (crypto/internal/fips140/mldsa/field.go:79)\tFUNCDATA\t$5, crypto/internal/fips140/mldsa.fieldSub.arginfo1(SB)\n\t0x0000 00000 (crypto/internal/fips140/mldsa/field.go:79)\tFUNCDATA\t$6, crypto/internal/fips140/mldsa.fieldSub.argliveinfo(SB)\n\t0x0000 00000 (crypto/internal/fips140/mldsa/field.go:79)\tPCDATA\t$3, $1\n\t0x0000 00000 (crypto/internal/fips140/mldsa/field.go:80)\tSUBL\tBX, AX\n\t0x0002 00002 (crypto/internal/fips140/mldsa/field.go:80)\tADDL\t$8380417, AX\n\t0x0007 00007 (<unknown line number>)\tNOP\n\t0x0007 00007 (crypto/internal/fips140/mldsa/field.go:71)\tXCHGL\tAX, AX\n\t0x0008 00008 (crypto/internal/fips140/mldsa/field.go:70)\tMOVL\tAX, CX\n\t0x000a 00010 (crypto/internal/fips140/mldsa/field.go:70)\tSUBQ\t$8380417, AX\n\t0x0010 00016 (crypto/internal/fips140/mldsa/field.go:70)\tSBBQ\tDX, DX\n\t0x0013 00019 (crypto/internal/fips140/mldsa/field.go:70)\tMOVQ\tDX, BX\n\t0x0016 00022 (crypto/internal/fips140/mldsa/field.go:70)\tNEGQ\tDX\n\t0x0019 00025 (crypto/internal/fips140/subtle/constant_time.go:63)\tANDQ\tCX, BX\n\t0x001c 00028 (crypto/internal/fips140/subtle/constant_time.go:63)\tLEAQ\t-1(DX), CX\n\t0x0020 00032 (crypto/internal/fips140/subtle/constant_time.go:63)\tANDQ\tCX, AX\n\t0x0023 00035 (crypto/internal/fips140/subtle/constant_time.go:63)\tORQ\tBX, AX\n\t0x0026 00038 (crypto/internal/fips140/mldsa/field.go:81)\tRET\n\t0x0000 29 d8 05 01 e0 7f 00 90 89 c1 48 2d 01 e0 7f 00  ).........H-....\n\t0x0010 48 19 d2 48 89 d3 48 f7 da 48 21 cb 48 8d 4a ff  H..H..H..H!.H.J.\n\t0x0020 48 21 c8 48 09 d8 c3                             H!.H...\n```\n\nAm I holding something wrong?\n",
