    "body": "Actually, sorry, I was holding it wrong for the subtle.ConstantTimeSelect case, I hadn't realized [CL 716120](https://go.dev/cl/716120) didn't land yet.\n\nsubtle.ConstantTimeSelect does emit the CMOVQNE now, although interestingly the IMUL3Q version avoids the ADDL+SUBQ, while the CMOVQNE version does not.\n\n```\ncrypto/internal/fips140/mldsa.fieldSub STEXTFIPS nosplit size=29 args=0x8 locals=0x0 funcid=0x0 align=0x0\n\t0x0000 00000 (crypto/internal/fips140/mldsa/field.go:79)\tTEXT\tcrypto/internal/fips140/mldsa.fieldSub(SB), NOSPLIT|NOFRAME|ABIInternal, $0-8\n\t0x0000 00000 (crypto/internal/fips140/mldsa/field.go:79)\tFUNCDATA\t$0, gclocals\u00b7g5+hNtRBP6YXNjfog7aZjQ==(SB)\n\t0x0000 00000 (crypto/internal/fips140/mldsa/field.go:79)\tFUNCDATA\t$1, gclocals\u00b7g5+hNtRBP6YXNjfog7aZjQ==(SB)\n\t0x0000 00000 (crypto/internal/fips140/mldsa/field.go:79)\tFUNCDATA\t$5, crypto/internal/fips140/mldsa.fieldSub.arginfo1(SB)\n\t0x0000 00000 (crypto/internal/fips140/mldsa/field.go:79)\tFUNCDATA\t$6, crypto/internal/fips140/mldsa.fieldSub.argliveinfo(SB)\n\t0x0000 00000 (crypto/internal/fips140/mldsa/field.go:79)\tPCDATA\t$3, $1\n\t0x0000 00000 (crypto/internal/fips140/mldsa/field.go:80)\tSUBL\tBX, AX\n\t0x0002 00002 (crypto/internal/fips140/mldsa/field.go:80)\tADDL\t$8380417, AX\n\t0x0007 00007 (<unknown line number>)\tNOP\n\t0x0007 00007 (crypto/internal/fips140/mldsa/field.go:70)\tMOVL\tAX, CX\n\t0x0009 00009 (crypto/internal/fips140/mldsa/field.go:70)\tSUBQ\t$8380417, AX\n\t0x000f 00015 (crypto/internal/fips140/mldsa/field.go:70)\tSBBQ\tDX, DX\n\t0x0012 00018 (crypto/internal/fips140/mldsa/field.go:70)\tNEGQ\tDX\n\t0x0015 00021 (crypto/internal/fips140/mldsa/field.go:71)\tTESTQ\tDX, DX\n\t0x0018 00024 (crypto/internal/fips140/mldsa/field.go:71)\tCMOVQNE\tCX, AX\n\t0x001c 00028 (crypto/internal/fips140/mldsa/field.go:81)\tRET\n\t0x0000 29 d8 05 01 e0 7f 00 89 c1 48 2d 01 e0 7f 00 48  )........H-....H\n\t0x0010 19 d2 48 f7 da 48 85 d2 48 0f 45 c1 c3           ..H..H..H.E..\n```\n",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
